# Generated coverage/flake artifacts (never committed). registry.toml IS committed.
#
# duration.json is ALSO COMMITTED and is deliberately absent from this list. It
# is the only durable cross-run duration history: results/*.json,
# results/summary.txt and every *.log are gitignored, so without a committed
# duration record nothing can compare two runs of the same scenario. It costs a
# few hundred bytes and regenerating it requires re-flying the whole suite.
coverage.json
coverage.txt
flake.json
__pycache__/
